              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:comments:nk]' member='&quot;muy satisfecho con la experiencia vivida en esta comunidad.&#10; quisiera tener mas contacto con algun agente para ir mejorando y ampliando la oportunidad de venta&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:comments:nk]' member='&quot;my foodpanda device doesnt have access to restaurant portal (I have already requested many times but not resolved yet) and your system is very difficult especially in adding new products and photos because it goes to your back office team. why not copy Grab Mart&apos;s system where they give us merchants control and not need to go through your back office.&quot;' />
